Installing PlaSim-LSG on Lorenz at IMAU

Last edited: 2025-10-25, Reyk Boerner

Steps to compile PlaSim-LSG
1. cd PLASIM (the current directory)
2. module load tbb compiler-rt oclfpga
3. module load compiler/2024.0.0
4. module load netCDF/GCC/4.7.0
5. module load cdo/1
6. ./configure.sh
7. ./most.x -c

After modifying the source code:
- Recompile
- copy the most_plasim_t21_l10_p1.x file from PLASIM/plasim/run/ to the desired run folder.
